# Shreeram Daily Milk — mobile app environment variables
#
# Copy this file to .env.local (or .env) and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit a file containing real values — only this .example file
# with placeholders belongs in version control.
#
# Only EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables are available to the mobile app bundle.
# Expo inlines them at build time, so they are visible to anyone who
# inspects the built app. Do not put secrets here — only the Supabase
# project URL and the publishable (anon) key, which are designed to be
# public and are protected by Row-Level Security on the server.
#
# Added in Stage 2 (Supabase, authentication, customers and workers):

# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# Never add SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY or any other privileged key here.
# Privileged keys belong only in Supabase Edge Functions / server environments,
# never in this mobile app's environment or source code.
